
# Tasks

- [ ] Frontend Setup: Set up a new React project using Next.js, HTML, CSS, and Tailwind CSS. <!-- id: 0 -->
- [ ] Backend Setup: Initialize a Python/Django backend and integrate PostgreSQL. <!-- id: 1 -->
- [ ] User Auth: Implement user authentication (registration, login, session management). <!-- id: 2 -->
- [ ] LLM Integration: Integrate with an external LLM API (e.g., OpenAI, Gemini) for text generation. <!-- id: 3 -->
- [ ] RAG Embedding Model: Choose and integrate an embedding model for converting text to vectors. <!-- id: 4 -->
- [ ] RAG Vector DB Setup: Set up a vector database (e.g., `pgvector` extension for PostgreSQL) to store content embeddings. <!-- id: 5 -->
- [ ] Curated Content Ingestion: Develop a process to ingest, chunk, and embed curated content into the vector database. <!-- id: 6 -->
- [ ] Web Content Retrieval: Develop a `WebSearchAndScrapingService` to retrieve relevant programming content from the internet. <!-- id: 7 -->
- [ ] Content Preprocessing: Implement logic to extract, clean, and chunk both curated and retrieved web content. <!-- id: 8 -->
- [ ] RAG Content Indexing: Develop a unified process to embed and index both the curated and retrieved web content into the vector database. <!-- id: 9 -->
- [ ] Voice Assistant: Implement Speech-to-Text (STT) and Text-to-Speech (TTS) capabilities for the voice assistant on the frontend. <!-- id: 10 -->
- [ ] Dynamic Lesson Synthesis: Develop backend logic to synthesize lessons and explanations from retrieved content using LLM+RAG. <!-- id: 11 -->
- [ ] Whiteboard Visuals: Integrate a canvas library (e.g., `react-konva`) for creating interactive whiteboard animations. <!-- id: 12 -->
- [ ] Editor Integration: Embed a code editor (e.g., `Monaco Editor`) for coding challenges. <!-- id: 13 -->
- [ ] Quiz System: Create a module for interactive quizzes. <!-- id: 14 -->
- [ ] Progress Tracking: Implement user progress tracking (lesson completion, scores). <!-- id: 15 -->
- [ ] Adaptation Engine Core: Develop core logic for user skill analysis and contextual understanding. <!-- id: 16 -->
- [ ] Gamification: Add basic gamification elements (points for completion). <!-- id: 17 -->
- [ ] Forum Placeholder: Integrate a placeholder for a community forum or Q&A section. <!-- id: 18 -->
- [ ] Real-time Interaction: Implement WebSockets for real-time communication. <!-- id: 19 -->
